mouth pain in particular, so thank you.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.650
Part 3: Our podcast.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:28.320
It's going to be called Dear Hank and John,
or as I like to think of it, Dear John and

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.320
