and Mars.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:39.730
Nerdfighters, if you want to send us a question
or a problem, you can do so.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:42.240
We're at hankandjohn@gmail.com.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.150
Part 4: In the meanwhile, you can listen to
the Tour Because Awesome Podcast, featuring

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:47.280
Hank and his friends.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.280
Link in the dooblydoo.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.960
Part 5: Hank, last night I had this weird
dream that my friend Hannah Hart was a professional

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:56.450
trapeze artist working with a trapeze collective
called "The flyerz" with a 'z'.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:58.970
No real story there, I just wanted to share
that image with you.

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:02.720
Part 6: Hank, DFTBA Records has a new CEO
Jo Garrett.

