00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:46.100
We also have some of these awesome Nerdfighteria
Wimbledon scarfs still available at dftba.com

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.539
-- link in the dooblydoo.

00:01:47.539 --> 00:01:50.840
Part 9: In case you're wondering why I'm in
front of this white wall, new video background

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:51.850
coming soon.

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:55.310
Part 10: Over at hankgames, I'm currently
taking a moral journey through the video game

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:59.520
"Grand Theft Auto," exploring the question
