00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:05.869
Also, how do you play this game without running
over people's feet?

00:02:05.869 --> 00:02:07.929
Part 11: Bank of Nerdfighteria update.

00:02:07.929 --> 00:02:12.050
So Hank, ad revenue from this channel Vlogbrothers
gets split in half between the Foundation

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:16.140
to Decrease Worldsuck, Nerdfighteria's charity,
and a fund that sponsors educational content

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:18.760
