Diet."

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:23.340
So far, for this year, the Foundation to Decrease
Worldsuck has raised about $40,000, mostly

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:29.060
from people watching ads on Vlogbrothers,
so thank you for ingesting all of that advertising.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:32.560
But we've also gotten a bunch of money from
"Tab for a Cause," a browser extension that

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:36.790
allows you to make money for charity just
by surfing the web.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:40.489
Really does work, it was built by Nerdfighters,
there is a link in the dooblydoo.

00:02:40.489 --> 00:02:43.930
